window.products.push({"id":814008,"name":"Blancho Bedding Split King Microfiber Solid Sheet Set (Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VJCoKJP7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Super-soft and long lasting, Microfiber add a bright touch to your bedding. Fitted sheets made with elastic all around and Fits up to a 18\"\" mattress. Set includes one fitted sheet, one flat sheet, and a pair of pillowcases (one with twin). Machine washable. 100% brushed polyester microfiber. These sheets feel as soft as 600 Thread count cotton sheets, and hold better in washing. 5PC Split King Sheet set Includes: 1 King Flat Sheet 110x102\" 2 Twin Fitted Sheets 39x80\" Each. 2 King Pillow cases 20x40\" Each.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VJCoKJP7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blancho Bedding","source_asin":"B008EODB64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008EODB64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008EODB64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":814009,"name":"X-large 2-screw replacement handle for vintage Revere Ware pans","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616uDo3sDUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Restore your vintage Revere Ware with these replacement 2-screw handles from RevereWareParts!  These are X-LARGE sized replacement handles for vintage era Revere Ware pans. They fit some Revere Ware sauce pans and skillets made between the early 1940's and 1968 that have two screws through the opposite ends of Bakelite part of the handle.  Please see the sizing instructions included in the photos to determine if this handle is the proper size for you.  IMPORTANT DETAILS  - Each package comes with the two handle halves and replacement hardware. - The handles are made from Bakelite and the hardware is stainless steel. - The screws and nuts are not interchangeable with original Revere Ware hardware - Handles are 5.7 in long, 3.7 in between holes on center, and fit a 3/4 inch metal spline. - Don't over-tighten the screws as Bakelite can be brittle.   FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS  Are the handles oven safe?  No, the handles are not safe to use in an oven.  Are the handles dishwasher safe? Repeated washing in a dishwasher will dull the finish of Bakelite handles.   Will these handles fit any other cookware brands? These handles are made only for the specific Revere Ware types above and will not fit any other types or brands of cookware.   What other Revere Ware replacement parts are available? We also sell a number of other replacement parts made for Revere Ware cookware. You can find our complete list of items available on Amazon.com by clicking on our name under the Buy Now button and selecting the Products tab.  TROUBLESHOOTING  If you are unsure if these handles are the correct ones for you, have problems with installation, or need any other help, please don’t hesitate to contact us. Just click on our name under the Buy Now button and then use the Ask a Question button on our seller page.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616uDo3sDUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RevereWareParts.com","source_asin":"B001U2J1HK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001U2J1HK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001U2J1HK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
