window.products.push({"id":814095,"name":"Kids Alarm Clock, LED Digital Alarm Clock with Time-Date-Alarm, Snooze, 7 Colours Night Light Bedroom Alarm Clock for Toddlers, Boys and Girls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715Au+7nZnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰ Never Let Your Child be Late Again! -Waking up early is a pain for most people, and it's no different for kids. So, in response to the screams, moans and worries of kids who don't want to get up, we've developed a kids unicorn alarm clock with glow-in-the-dark to wake them up with a gentle chime to get them through the morning. ⏰ Unicorn Alarm Clock needs to be powered by USB charging cable or 4 AAA carbon batteries (not included) to display 7-color night light, alarm, date, temperature and time. The simple and cute design allows you to take it with you in the bedroom, kitchen, office or on the go, which is very convenient and can even be given as a gift to your kids and friends. ⏰ Keep Kids Out of the Dark - when they are scared or need to get up, the unicorn alarm clock produces a soft light in seven different colors to create a different atmosphere in the bedroom or home. If you want to check the time or find something at night, you can tap the top of the clock and it will emit a soft light for 5 seconds and then turn off automatically. Let the bedroom alarm clock night light accompany your child to escape the darkness ⏰ Features Multi Functional LED Display - LED shows time (12 and 24 hour time format), day of the week, date, temperature (°F or °C), press \"SET\" to activate Unicorn Kids Alarm Clock, press up/down to set the hour-minute - year-month-day-week sequence for kids ⏰ SAFE MATERIALS - The alarm clock case is made of high quality ABS material which is highly rigid and tough and 100% non-toxic. Parents can rest assured that their children will be able to use our alarm clocks.ABS material is not easily damaged or worn out and is really safe for your children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715Au+7nZnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Medxin","source_asin":"B0BBQ9TT2T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBQ9TT2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBQ9TT2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
