window.products.push({"id":814284,"name":"Shabbos Blech Flat (26\" x 20\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m1gnWcF6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Aluminum Shabbat Blechs are customarily used on Shabbos and placed between the gas stovetop and food, so that the food stays warm throughout Shabbos. We have three blech styles Flat Blech(current product) L Shape Blech: These are flat and thin but have a lip to cover the oven knobs. These are ideal for families with young children who might tinker with a lit stovetop. Water Blech The water blech has a hollow center where water can be placed, this is ideal for higher heat levels. But make sure the water doesn't boil out! We also sell the Blech Book: The complete guide to Blechs! Please note that ALL Shabbat Blechs are new and might have some scratches from the manufacturing and shipping process. This is something that is unavoidable. We've been selling Shabbat Blechs since 1992 and so we know a thing or two! **** WILL NOT WORK WITH INDUCTION OVEN ****","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m1gnWcF6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"blech","source_asin":"B08RXGSQTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RXGSQTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RXGSQTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
