window.products.push({"id":814346,"name":"Mountain Landscape Abstract Painting Canvas Wall Art For Living Room Bathroom Wall Decor For Bedroom Kitchen Artwork Canvas Prints 3 Pieces Modern Fra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":78.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kZKcmhyHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Mountain Landscape Abstract Painting Canvas Wall Art For Living Room Bathroom Wall Decor For Bedroom Kitchen Artwork Canvas Prints 3 Pieces Modern Framed Office Home Decorations Watercolor Picture Introduction: 1: It Is Canvas Prints Works,Not Hand-Painted Painting,There Is Not Difference In The Product Itself,But Colors May Appear Slightly Different To Each User Due To Individual Monitors. 2: Each Panel Of Canvas Print Already Stretched On Solid Wooden Frames,And Comes With Hook Attached，Put Into A Plastic Bag And Then Put Into Solid Master Carton For Shipping. 3: Canvas Print Printed At Hi-Res On Quality Thick Artist Premium Canvas With Extra Mirrored Border. 4:The Solid Wood Mounted Canvas Prints Is Stylish, Attractive And Suitable For Any Contemporary, Modern, Vintage Or Retro Decor Indoor Wall Art. Benefits: This Art Work Comes Already Framed Ready To Hang, Each Panel Has A Wide Hook Already Attached For Easy Hanging. If The Product Has Damaged During Delivery,You Can Contact Us To Return Refund Or Change A New One. Fast Shipping, Risk Free For Purchase, 30 Days Money Back Guarantee Of Reciept Of Shipment. Great Inspirational Art Room For Wall Decor: Perfect Choice For Wall Decor Such As Living Room, Bedroom, Guest Room, Bathroom, Kitchen, Dinning Room, Meeting Room, Hallway, Nurseries, Coffee House, Condo House, Hotels, Inn, Spa, Lounge, Sauna And Other Spaces Of Home, Family, Office, Business, Reflection And Relaxation. Perfect Gift Idea: For Wedding, Anniversary, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Mother'S Day, Father'S Day, Valentine, Birthday And Others. Important For Size: Size：20x28 Inches Each Panel,Total 3 Panels Please Note Display Pictures Are Only For Illustration Purposes. They Were Not Taken In Real Display Rooms And Do Not Represent The Real Size Of The Set. Please Measure Your Wall Properly And Make Sure You Pick The Right Size.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kZKcmhyHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TTHYUEWS","source_asin":"B09F8SFW8H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F8SFW8H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F8SFW8H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":814347,"name":"Dale Tiffany Lamps AV21008 Plazio Hand Blown Art Glass Vase, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810kknMljaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Plazio Hand Blown Art Glass Vase is an unparalleled blending of vintage charm and modern-day accents that will take center stage in any décor style. The updated bottle vase features a gracefully scalloped wide mouth, outlined in bright amber, to accommodate large floral arrangements. The exterior wall begins with a clay-colored background that is accented with vertical black brushstrokes and splatters. A bright blue basket weave overlay is accented with bright amber Gerbera daisies, each dotted with pearly art glass centers. Beautifully detailed green leaves throughout add extra color, texture, and visual interest. Plazio is crafted of hand blown Favrile art glass, first invented by L.C. Tiffany in the late Nineteenth Century. The Favrile process embeds the color within the glass itself. The process allows for subtle variations in color and texture, which means no 2 pieces are exactly alike. A pretty finishing touch on mantles, dining, or console tables, our Plazio Hand Blown Art Glass makes a lovely gift for that special someone in your life. NOTE: Due to the nature of handmade art glass, colors, sizes and patterns may vary slightly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810kknMljaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dale Tiffany Lamps","source_asin":"B09MGDQZMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MGDQZMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MGDQZMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
