window.products.push({"id":814394,"name":"SUSTEAS 2.0 Liter 68oz Glass Pitcher with Lid, Easy Clean Heat Resistant Glass Water Carafe with Handle for Hot/Cold Beverages - Water, Cold Brew, Ice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jNQBr4mbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Superior Material for Durability And Safety】: SUSTEAS water pitcher is made of heat-resistant borosilicate glass, which can withstand temperatures from -20°C ~150°C/-4°F~302°F. Its lead-free and BPA-free construction makes it a healthier choice for daily use. Refrigerator Safe (some applicable) & Stovetop Safe (low heat). ✅【Designed for Homemade Beverages】: This glass pitcher comes with a dual opening 18/8 stainless steel lid, which can be adjusted as you like, making it easy to retain pulp and ice cubes or pour beverages quickly. The drip-proof spout and ergonomic handle make pouring a breeze, and the food-grade silicone around the lid fits snugly against the body of the jug to avoid wetting the countertop. ✅【Classic Carafe for Stylish Serving】: ACTUAL LOAD CAPACITY: 1800ml. This beverage pitcher with lid is well designed that you can clearly feel it - the thicker walls and clearly visible glass, combined with the geometric aesthetics, give you the confidence to have the best experience wherever you want to use it. Ideal for everyday use or entertaining guests, this jug is perfect for a variety of drinks such as iced tea, margaritas, juice, coffee, sangrias, wine, etc. ✅【Focus On Detail | Ingenious Craftsmanship】: This iced tea jug is designed to provide a pleasant drinking experience and easy cleaning. Hand blown by professional craftsmen - smooth surface, wide diameter and simple structure design, plus we come with a free long-handled cleaning soft brush that makes interior cleaning a breeze. ✅【Exquisite Packaging | Excellent Customer Service】: SUSTEAS Glass Pitcher is the perfect Christmas gift for your loved ones to cherish and appreciate! We are dedicated to premium customer service and stand behind our products with a full one-year. If you need assistance with the product, please contact us immediately and we will resolve your issues to your satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jNQBr4mbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUSTEAS","source_asin":"B0BCL7MNNY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCL7MNNY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCL7MNNY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
