window.products.push({"id":814470,"name":"Wood-Paper-Towel-Holder-Under-Cabinet-Kitchen-Handmade - Wall Mounted/Adhesive No Drill Sturdy Roll Hanging Organizer, Horizontal Papertowel Dispenser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vpE6yZ9OS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Exclusive Design】 Klleyna wood paper towel holder undermount for kitchen roll is practical and compact. Symmetrically designed large base uniforms the strength of tearing, won’t break off like others installed on one side. Perfect to install with adhesive tapes under cabinet/cupboard, over cabinet door and countertop 【Adhesive/Screw in】This under the cabinet paper towel holder equipped with 3 pcs high quality Nano double-side self adhesive tapes and screw & anchor kit for installation. The transparent tapes stick up to any smooth surfaces such as wood, tile, grass and marble, leaving no marks when removed. 2 kinds of screw lengths provided for wood and hard wall mounting 【Fit for Rolls of All Size】 Precisely measured slots allows the rod to slide in but not easy to fall off, 11.8” (30 cm) inside width and 4.4” (11.2) in depth. Compact to hold various size of kitchen mounted hand paper towel rolls: regular, big, mega, super, double, gigantic, huge, and triple from most brands such as Bounty, Presto, Sparkle, Tork, Brawny, Viva, etc.. Slide-in hanging wooden rod construction is convenient to change paper towels without forcing the rack 【Functional Organizer for Home】This command paper towel holder wall mount can also hold storage bags, tin foil, towel, parchment baking paper, cups, utensils and other stuffs. Various usage scenarios according to your needs. Use as a dark vintage hallway key holders, bathroom toilet roll hanger and bedroom clothes hook are also good choices, replacing other types such as acacia, pineapple, cherry, bamboo, stainless steel, plastic , strip, boho and farmhouse type 【Superior Handmade Decorative Gift】High-end original mountable hanging rack is made of solid wood material and exquisite craftsmanship from art workshop determined extraordinary quality of this paper towel holder. Smoothly-finished surface with nice grain and wood texture, coated with wax oil for waterproof. Great gift for housewarming, thanksgiving, wedding, halloween, birthday, Christmas, Mother’s Day and Father’s Day","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vpE6yZ9OS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KLLEYNA","source_asin":"B08XYT25QG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XYT25QG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XYT25QG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
