window.products.push({"id":814617,"name":"26\" Space Heater for Indoor Use, Grelife 1500W PTC Fast Heating Oscillating Ceramic Heater with Thermostat, Remote, Overheat&Tip-Over Protection, 12H ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XmFprtqvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Fast Heating in Seconds】Grelife 1500-watt powerful ceramic heating element allows this space heater for indoor use to quickly heat and promote faster heat release, making your whole body wrapped in warmth instantly. The widespread oscillation portable heater sweeps around your whole living space, delivering more effective, immediate and evenly wide-reaching heat for larger rooms, garages, bedrooms, living rooms and offices 【Safety Protections】ETL-Listed. PTC electric ceramic heater features V-0 flame retardant material to prevent electrical risks and safeguard your home. Built-in overheating protection and a tip-over safety switch, this space heater for bedroom will precisely sensor the heating temperature and shut off when it reaches 122°F, providing you with a safer and warmer winter 【Customized Warmth Comfort】The room space heater personalizes your warmth with 3 heating modes (High: 1500W, Low: 1000W, ECO Mode) and a digital thermostat from 60 to 89°F in 1°F increments to so you can beat the cold while saving more energy bills. With unique heating technology, this electric heater creates quiet heat with noise level as low as 40dB (quiet like a library). Equipped with display auto off, calm and soft airflow lets you sleep soundly and work undisturbed during the cold winter 【Energy-efficient】Smart ECO mode automatically adjusts the heat level and helps energy-saving based on your real-time temperature and saving more on energy bills in the meantime. The indoor electric space heater portable keeps your large room cozy and comfortable all the time 【Touch & Remote Control】Featured with intelligent LED screen and touch control panel design, Grelife 26inch space heater for large room is easy to operate all functions with 3 heating modes, timer, oscillation, and temperature. You can also easily control your heater at your fingertips with a handy remote. Meanwhile, child lock mode will avoid accidental touch 【Maximum Convenience】The built-in 12 hours timer can nicely fulfill your need for the warmth of the entire room at day or night. The carry handle design provides max portability and makes this portable heater super easy to move to your bedroom, garage, living room, office, etc. Space-saving and easy to store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XmFprtqvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grelife","source_asin":"B0B8RL4DDC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814617","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8RL4DDC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8RL4DDC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":814618,"name":"colors of rajasthan Indian Kantha Blanket, Bed Cover, King Kantha Bedspread, Bohemian Bedding Kantha Hippie Quilts (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QimgAB2rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made with 100% cotton and natural vegetable colors. This piece is of art is completely hand stitched by Women artisan in Rajasthan, India. It can make any room alive with its vivid colors, stunning bird print and embroidery, made using traditional and famous kantha hand embroidery method. Made from two thin layer of cotton fabric make this piece of art irresistible and also very comfortable. Adding to it's style, this kantha quilt is reversible and both sides can be used. Kantha is still the most popular form of embroidery practiced by rural women.typically use old saris and cloth and layer them with kantha stitch to make a light blanket, throw or bedspread. These cotton lightweight \"Quilts\" with a beautiful and colorful Bird design can be used as 1. Bedspread , Bedding Throw , Blanket Or Quilt 2. A Summer Bed Cover 3. A Throw 4. A Fabulous Picnic Rug 5. Nice Bedroom Quilt , This can fit to a 90 x 108 inch's wide King size bed as blanket or throw or can easily fit as bedspread / bed cover to King bed .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QimgAB2rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"colors of rajasthan","source_asin":"B00PE1LDVA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PE1LDVA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PE1LDVA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
