window.products.push({"id":814696,"name":"Department 56 Snowbabies “You’re The Best Gift of All” Porcelain Ornament, 2.76”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MEy1Sm0GL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"For over 30 years, Department 56 artist Kristi Jensen Pierro has captured the beauty and splendor of winter in her classic Snowbabies collection. Directly inspired by Kristi’s life experiences, each Snowbabies piece is carefully named to share a sentiment of love, friendship, or inspiration. Show someone how much you love them with this 2.76” hanging porcelain ornament from the Snowbabies Celebrations line. BFFs Snowbaby and snowman stand back-to-back concealing their gifts to one another. Incidentally, they both plan on gifting the same thing: poinsettias! A red hand-knit cap adorns the head of the snowman friend. The ornament comes ready to hang on an elegant Snowbabies ribbon. Handcrafted from creamy bisque porcelain, this highly detailed figurine features a proprietary Snowbabies “snowsuit” that adds depth and dimension. Hand-painted accents provide a distinctive artistic touch that ensures this item will remain a treasured piece for years to come. Each Snowbabies figurine comes boxed in decorative packaging for easy gifting. About Us: Enesco is committed to bringing joy every day. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, plush, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: GUND, Department 56 Village, Gregg Gift, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Walt Disney Archives Collection, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Pusheen, Designs by Lolita, Our Name Is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MEy1Sm0GL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00SOFBTOO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SOFBTOO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SOFBTOO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":814697,"name":"#1 Bamboo Cutting Board Set, 3 Piece Eco-Friendly Premium Quality Bamboo Wood Cutting Board Chopping Block with Handle, Small, Medium and Large Knife ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GKJnIGHxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Durable, High Quality, Eco-Friendly Cutting Boards to Upgrade Any Kitchen - Our bamboo cutting boards are easy to maintain and easy to store. We recommend washing the cutting board in lukewarm water and regular dish soap. Bamboo cutting boards should not be cleaned in the dishwasher to avoid damaging the boards. Users should store the boards in a cool, dry area. Apply food-grade mineral oil and rub it into the wood every month. This helps prevent the cutting surface from getting split, broken or warped. Because bamboo is less porous than wood, there is less room for bacteria to take hold and make people ill. When oiling your bamboo cutting board set, do NOT use olive oil, walnut oil or any other type of oil besides Food Grade Mineral Oil on the bamboo. Doing so should help maintain the wooden cutting board Bamboo is a 100% renewable resource. -This three piece cutting board set is environmentally friendly, versatile, functional and beautiful. - Our bamboo cutting board set includes a small, medium and large cutting board in each purchase. There is plenty of food prep space for the whole family. The boards measure as follows: ♣ Large: 13\" x 9.5\" ♣ Medium: 11\" x 8.5\" ♣ Small: 8\" x 6\" We offer a no-questions-asked, 100% money back guarantee on every product sold. If you are not happy for any reason, please return to use for a full refund. The set provides cooks a surface size for every need. Choose bamboo for your cutting board needs – it is the natural alternative for everything wood! BUY ONE TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GKJnIGHxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NAKED BAMBOO","source_asin":"B00I2E9M5A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I2E9M5A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I2E9M5A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":814698,"name":"RTIC Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Water Bottle, 17 oz, Maroon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mNE8HQM5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This 17oz bottle is perfectly sized to keep you hydrated all day long from your morning commute, to meetings, to yoga class, to the tennis court, to work. You name it, take this bottle with you!Designed to keep beverages cold for 24 hours and hot for 6, our water bottles feature double wall construction with an extra interior copper layer for superior performance.Our bottles are made from premium grade, 18/8 stainless steel that’s non-toxic, non-leaching and BPA free.Vacuum insulated to keep liquids and carbonated beverages fresh.The exterior will never sweat. Don't worry about getting water on your desk, rings on your table, or a mess in your bag! The bottle won't even be hot or cold to the touch no matter the temperature of the liquid.Fits Most Cup Holders - The shape of this 17oz bottle will fit normal sized cup holders and the narrow mouth makes it easy to drink from on the go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mNE8HQM5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RTIC","source_asin":"B073S1YNTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073S1YNTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073S1YNTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
