window.products.push({"id":814816,"name":"Travel Utensils Portable Utensils Set Travel Camping Cutlery Set Reusable Utensils Set with Case Stainless Steel Flatware Set 9-Pieces with Knife Fork","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zNO-piYKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【HEALTH AND ECO-FRIENDLY】 The travel utensils is made of high-quality food-grade stainless steel. During the trip, you can say no to disposable tableware. By choosing our reusable portable utensils set, you can avoid using plastics that take centuries to decompose. In addition, the stainless steel material of the travel tableware is easy to clean. The mirror polished surface and ergonomic shape of the travel camping cutlery set are reusable and durable, and provide a better dining experience. 【ERGONOMIC DESIGN】 The ergonomic handle of our travel utensils set is designed according to the posture of the hand, with appropriate weight and perfect balance. Ensure maximum comfort while using our portable utensils set and avoid getting tired of those straight stainless steel flatware set handles. In addition, the smooth edges of travel camping cutlery set ensure safety and no scratches. The high-quality polishing of this travel cutlery set makes it particularly suitable for modern style. 【EVERYTHING YOU NEED】 This travel cutlery set has a simple shape and smooth edges, anti-oxidation, stylish. The travel utensils includes knife, fork, spoon, chopsticks, straws cleaning brush, straight straw, curved straw, wipes, portable case. Putting the portable utensils set in a backpack or suitcase won't take up much space or weight. Choose travel camping cutlery set to enjoy a healthy and eco-friendly life, the stainless steel travel tableware is a must-have for daily use. 【EASY TO CARRY & CLEAN】 The travel utensils is characterized by its compactness and lightness. When you go to school, work, picnic, camping, or any other activities, you only need to put the portable utensils set in your backpack, purse or pocket, and you can take the reusable utensils set almost anywhere you want to go. This travel camping cutlery set is small in size and light in weight. Unlike plastic and silicone tableware, stainless steel makes this travel tableware very easy to clean. 【HIGH-END ELEGANT DESIGN】 This travel camping cutlery set is made of food-grade stainless steel, which has the advantages of durability, rust-proof. The smooth and polished surface combined with the elegant colors make the travel utensils special. The travel cutlery set can be paired with any style of kitchen to meet everyone's basic dining needs. Whether you are a traditional retro lover or a trendy cyber fan, you will be satisfied with this reusable portable utensils set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zNO-piYKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ACukCuk","source_asin":"B09DFYXJSV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DFYXJSV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DFYXJSV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
