window.products.push({"id":814874,"name":"TRINEAR 14in Steel Twin Bed Frame, Black Metal Mattress Platform, Tool-Free Assembly, 550Lbs Load Capacity, No Spring Box Needed and Ample Underbed St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fLhCSEv0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MATERIAL & LOAD CAPACITY】This metal bed frame is adopted with high-quality iron and is finely coated with paint, so the whole frame will not easily get oxidized. With 9 supportive legs holding the whole basis, this metal platform can bear 550 Lbs at maximum 【NO NOISE NO WOBBLE】With the strong and durable materials and structures used, this black metal bed foundation makes little noise and shall not wobble even when you toss and turn. This may be an inappropriate example, for you may hardly get such a chance to lose sleep in this bed frame 【SCENES & RELIABILITY】You can use this steel bed frame in your bedroom, attic, van, or any other spots. Four sets of metal slats sturdily hold up your mattress, and specially offered 6 plastic buckles, 2 on each long side and 1 on each short side could stabilize your mattress and make sure it won’t move 【ASSEMBLY & DESIGN】The assembly is super easy, 2 adults should be able to finish it within 40mins usually. All the tools and accessories are included in the package, and all you need to do is just follow the manual. When the assembly is done, this bed frame will present a simple feel and fit in various decorating styles 【DIMENSIONS & STORING SPACE】The full dimensions of this bed frame are 39.0(L)*74.8(W)*13.8(H) inches, no box spring needed and there’s a 14-inch high storage space under this bed frame, where you could conserve something like trunks, shoe boxes, etc 【OTHER NOTES】Please note that this bed frame does not come with a mattress. No extra tools are needed, the only tools you’re going to use are the two L-shaped wrenches we offered","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fLhCSEv0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRINEAR","source_asin":"B09TDR8S4L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-814874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TDR8S4L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TDR8S4L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
